# Local/CI run artifacts — regenerated each run, never committed.
digest.md
digest_title.txt

# Private job-search state. This repo is public; these three describe where Kris
# has applied and how the rubric scored his live targets. They live in the
# private state repo instead (STATE_REPO secret) and are synced in/out by the
# workflow. Missing = the pipeline still runs, it just loses duplicate
# suppression, so a local checkout without them is safe but noisier.
data/applied.json
data/matches.json
data/matches.md

# Materials builder: installed in CI via `npm ci --prefix materials`
materials/node_modules/
materials/out/
